schema ChaosMeshOrgV1alpha1ScheduleSpecStressChaosStressors:
    r"""
    Stressors defines plenty of stressors supported to stress system components out.
    You can use one or more of them to make up various kinds of stresses. At least
    one of the stressors should be specified.

    Attributes
    ----------
    cpu : ChaosMeshOrgV1alpha1ScheduleSpecStressChaosStressorsCPU, default is Undefined, optional
        cpu
    memory : ChaosMeshOrgV1alpha1ScheduleSpecStressChaosStressorsMemory, default is Undefined, optional
